      "mergeID": "6a7b039856ec59355458b639",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I would like an SDK component that doesn't allow portals to be placed in certain areas while they can in others.\n\nMaybe something like Team Fortress 2's func_nobuild, a trigger area that disallows Engineer buildings from being built inside the trigger https://developer.valvesoftware.com/wiki/Func_nobuild\n\nThis would allow world creators to limit what areas portals can be placed, rather than disabling them outright like we can currently. A use case example would be game worlds with a separate lobby from the game area, where users can place a portal in the lobby, but not in the game area where the portal could be used maliciously.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add an SDK component that disallows portals being placed in certain areas",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "608cbb519310c440b0d39adc",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe some options on the zone would be useful too. Like allow us to designate a zone to only allow \"Locked Portals\".\n\nI think the Locked Portal feature is still very odd, since it is a bit unintuitive. But for game worlds where you might have private little home areas, creating a portal for just you and a friend might be better than an \"unlocked\" portal which could be maliciously placed.\n\nWould also be useful if the zone could be set to allow the instance owner to still place portals.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "67d2ebc13221e039184baa42",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "610d538d5303a82960a415b4",
        "alias": "Solar Coral",
        "aliasID": "65c26df1ed6eefce4c5aac21",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/fe96fc268af68b13b8255713fdd44c24.png",
        "created": "2021-08-06T15:21:49.596Z",
        "name": "Deantwo",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "5df404cc2072644ac4b5e385",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2025-03-13T14:29:21.998Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "deletedAt": null,
      "fileURLs": [],
