      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name} \"Would also be useful if the zone could be set to allow the instance owner to still place portals.\"\n\nScope creep on features like this just means they'll get postponed to 2030.\n\nImo. this feature should just be a component that sits on the same `GameObject` as a `Collider` set to `IsTrigger`. It has to be be possible to use Udon to enable / disable / transform the objects locally per player.\n\nWith this you could use `Networking.LocalPlayer.isInstanceOwner` to set a zone active or not.",
